  "instructions": "In `slog.py`, write a reusable `SingletonMeta` metaclass (double-checked locking, one instance per class, `__init__` runs once, `reset_instance()` closes the instance) and finish `Logger(metaclass=SingletonMeta)`. The logger must raise `RuntimeError` when there is no open file and keep lines whole under concurrent writers.",
